flowchart TB
  accTitle: The moments of an online match
  accDescr: A match on play.autodarts.io is counted in the browser. For each of its moments, Tools for Autodarts in the browser calls a secret webhook of Home Assistant, and the online bridge turns the trigger of the call into a board event, such as online_busted and online_game_shot, for the light show and your automations.

  MATCH["A match on play.autodarts.io"] --> BROWSER["A browser with Tools for Autodarts"]
  BROWSER -->|"online bridge: a call<br/>to a secret webhook"| BRIDGE{{"The bridge reads<br/>the trigger of the call"}}
  BRIDGE --> EVENTS["Board events:<br/>online_busted, online_game_shot, …<br/>with the source online"]
  EVENTS --> USE["The light show<br/>and your automations"]

  classDef bot fill:#526cfe2e,stroke:#526cfe,stroke-width:2px
  classDef done fill:#16a34a2e,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:2px
  class BRIDGE bot
  class EVENTS,USE done
